    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight tensor mid-layer orchestration over adapter/fingerprint assets. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Responsibilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Normalize adapter/package/shard identifiers into a single scope key.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Produce a stable routing plan for downstream layers.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Use <ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_adapter_repository" kindref="compound">AdapterRepository</ref> and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_tensor_fingerprint_graph" kindref="compound">TensorFingerprintGraph</ref> as the first concrete tensor-summary stage above ANN retrieval. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
